---
description: Planning and implementation workflow for native Android changes
globs:
  - "**/*.kt"
  - "**/*.kts"
  - "**/*.xml"
  - "**/build.gradle"
  - "**/build.gradle.kts"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Native Android Agent Workflow

- Inspect existing patterns before creating new ones
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs over broad rewrites
- Keep UI, domain logic, data access, and platform integrations separated
- Prefer strong typing, explicit dependencies, and cancellable async work
- Flag ambiguous requirements instead of guessing when behavior may be unsafe
